WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.980
This show contains scenes that some viewers may find disturbing. Viewer discretion is advised.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:32.630
<i>Every morning, Mother heads 
to the field as the sun comes up.</i>

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.850
"I need help with picking medicinal herbs."

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:46.770
"Thank you very much."

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.010
There!

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:55.080
<i>She always works her 
hardest for Helina and me.</i>

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:56.690
Which is why...

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:35.990
<i>Hi there. It's me, Arc.</i>

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:41.520
<i>And my momentous first job is going to 
be guarding someone collecting medicinal herbs.</i>

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:47.450
Oh, you mean Seona's place.

00:02:47.450 --> 00:02:49.940
It's just beyond the plaza.

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:01.910
<i>It's the perfect kind of dull but meaningful job</i>

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.910
<i>for a guy trying to keep a low profile.</i>

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.210
Let's head over there!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.040
Go!

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:14.420
What a nice, peaceful place.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:16.970
This must be it.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:23.640
Helina, come here.

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.490
You've got crumbs all over your mouth.

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.500
Fhank yoo.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:37.570
Coming!

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:38.780
How can I help...

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:41.260
you?!

00:03:43.440 --> 00:03:46.170
A-A knight?

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:49.450
I-Is there anything I can do for you...?

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.860
Is Miss Marca available?

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.200
Huh?

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.960
U-Um, I'm Marca, actually.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.380
Oh, it's you.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.310
I've come to accept the job that was posted.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:04.600
D-Do you mean... my request?

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.100
Indeed.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.820
The request for protection 
while picking herbs.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:13.110
The guard job for picking 
herbs over in Rata Village?

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.290
You're serious about this?

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:21.070
You'd be able to take much bigger jobs 
if you joined up with a mercenary guild, y'know.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.170
<i>Heck no!</i>

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:25.290
<i>I'm not doing anything 
that risks exposing my identity.</i>

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:29.460
Well, I've got a bit 
of an interest in herb picking.

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.880
It should prove amusing.

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.510
Is that right?

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:35.830
Well, make sure you're 
gentle with the client.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.440
Gentle?

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.840
Here you go.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:43.420
<i>Well, that explains what he meant...</i>

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.560
I'm sorry,

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:47.890
but does someone as impressive as you

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:50.270
really want to accept my job, Sir Knight...?

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:51.320
I do.

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:54.580
In fact, I've got a bit 
of an interest in picking herbs.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:56.200
Thank goodness!

00:04:56.550 --> 00:05:01.070
Plus, this is the exact kind 
of early-game quest you start with!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.290
Huh?

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:04.670
My apologies! It's a personal matter.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:08.000
Now, regarding the specifics of the job...

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.530
Um, Sir Knight?

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:13.970
is it all right if we head out right now?

00:05:13.970 --> 00:05:16.410
Right away? That's not a problem, but...

00:05:16.910 --> 00:05:18.350
Wonderful!

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:20.130
Let me just get ready!

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:35.510
Miss Marca, is this job 
a matter of some urgency?

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:40.050
The posting mentioned how fanged boars

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:43.520
have been appearing around the village, 
necessitating protection...

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.490
But I'm curious 
as to the reason for your haste.

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:52.180
My mother will be coming home soon.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:54.920
And if she knew, she'd be against it...

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.250
She would?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:56.930
Yeah.

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.620
So please don't tell her.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:00.920
But why?

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:05.190
My father died last year...

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:09.260
And Mother has been 
raising us by herself since.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.390
That's quite admirable.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:15.590
Picking herbs was Father's job...

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:20.560
So I thought it'd help 
if I could do it for her instead.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:27.190
I want to make her happy.

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.520
<i>Talk about noble!</i>

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:31.640
<i>And she's still a little girl!</i>

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:36.480
<i>All I did when I was her age 
was play video games...</i>

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.720
<i>Still did that after growing up, actually.</i>

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:43.240
Um, Sir Knight...?

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:48.810
Then let us gather many herbs, 
so that your mother will be pleased.

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:49.730
Right!

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:03.780
This is quite deep into the woods.

00:07:03.780 --> 00:07:06.980
Look here, Sir Knight!

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:09.980
This one is called cocora.

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:13.910
It helps with cuts and scrapes, 
and is good for the skin.

00:07:16.380 --> 00:07:20.120
And you can burn this flower
to keep bugs away.

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:23.820
You're quite knowledgeable, Miss Marca.

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.110
No ledge a bull...?

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:28.840
You're like a teacher, is what I meant.

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:33.620
Father taught me all kinds of things!

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:37.130
If we go a bit further in, 
there's a kobumi tree!

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:38.760
This way, come on!

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:43.440
Miss Marca, get back!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.940
I can sense something. It may be...

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.320
A monster!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:11.590
A multi-tailed kitsune... 
No, a flying squirrel?

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.850
It's hurt.

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:17.550
That looks painful.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:21.370
Come on. It's okay, don't be afraid.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:27.600
See? Nothing to be afraid of.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.520
It was scared of us.

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:33.890
This is going to be my first time
trying this since I got here.

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.000
Let's see if it works.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:37.510
Sir Knight?

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.120
Heal.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.450
<b>Heal</b>

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:53.000
W-Wow! You know how to use healing spells!

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.350
You're just like a priest!

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:58.340
<i>I made good use of that monk skill.</i>

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.770
It's so cute!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.840
And it knows you helped it, too.

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:09.150
I'm just glad it's feeling better.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.220
Go on, head back to where you came from.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:18.210
Maybe it wants to follow you?

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.720
Uh, I see...

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:24.200
You should give it a name!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.800
Green... kitsune....

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.670
In that case...!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.740
How about "Fried Tofu" or "Tempura"?

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.320
I don't think it likes those.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:37.210
In that case...

00:09:38.450 --> 00:09:42.560
It's tail is fluffy like 
a dandelion, or tanpopo...

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:45.150
We mix that up for Ponta?

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:49.420
You like that, huh, Ponta?

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:53.320
Good for you, Ponta!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.920
It seems my journey now 
has an unexpected companion.

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.520
Let's go a bit further in!

00:09:58.520 --> 00:09:59.580
Right.

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.560
What are you whining about?

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:06.540
They're just some fanged boars.

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:09.960
Those weren't fanged boars!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:13.630
I've been a hunter a long time, 
and I've never seen anything like it...

00:10:13.630 --> 00:10:16.760
We're better off avoiding 
the forest from now on.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.460
Oh, Mrs. Seona!

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:25.090
Did you send Marca on some kind of errand?

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:26.460
No?

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:29.040
Marca should be at home, 
watching the house...

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.640
Well, there's supposed to 
be big monsters in the woods now.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:36.150
And this morning, 
I saw Marca leaving the village.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:40.160
But she had this fancy-looking knight with her,

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.410
so I don't think you have to worry...

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.400
Marca!

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.930
This is it!

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:14.150
This slope is a bit perilous.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.860
Miss Marca, let's find a safe route down...

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:19.440
Look—

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.260
out?

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:24.320
Yes! I knew it!

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:26.080
It's in full bloom!

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.080
The kobumi tree is all white!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.490
Just Look at it, Sir Knight!

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:33.490
I'm glad you're enjoying yourself.

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:40.080
Halt, Miss Marca!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:56.020
Episode 2

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:56.020
A First Job, a Girl's Wish, and an Approaching Shadow

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:12.610
The way Ponta reacts...

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:15.790
I guess we know who hurt Ponta, now!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.300
Are you hurt, Miss Marca?

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.520
Sir Knight!

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:47.160
Poison fog?

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.120
<i>A giant basilisk.</i>

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:59.120
<i>Spits poisonous fog, 
has paralyzing claws, and can petrify...</i>

00:12:59.400 --> 00:13:02.840
<i>A monster with a whole arsenal 
of status effect skills.</i>

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:07.050
<i>A player in one of the mid-tier 
classes would have trouble...</i>

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:59.770
<i>But as long as I am cautious, 
I can deal with it!</i>

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.450
<i>The way it's moving... 
if the game is anything to go by...</i>

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:09.620
This is bad!

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:19.290
The Holy Shield of Teutates!

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:24.040
I have no intention in seeing 
if I can be turned to stone.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:40.370
Okay, who's the weirdo who decided 
that these basilisks needed six legs?!

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.940
Four was plenty, wasn't it?!

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:53.990
This is it!

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:01.750
A combat skill belonging to 
the top-tier class Sacred Knight:

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:06.050
<b>J
u
d
g
m
e
n
t</b>

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.580
Judgment!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.680
It only took one?!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.480
That's crazy strong...

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:17.910
Was this skill always so powerful?

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:19.680
Or was I trying too hard?

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:21.490
Well, whatever the case,

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:27.100
it looks like my second monster 
slain was a giant basilisk!

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:31.400
A-Amazing...

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:35.000
You can rest easy now, Miss Marca.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.490
That was incredible, Sir Knight!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.960
I've only done what's 
expected of your guard.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:43.800
Everyone in town will be surprised!

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:46.500
They... will?

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:47.600
Of course!

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.560
I bet we'll all be celebrating tonight!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.920
Oh, no!

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:54.700
F-Forgive me, but...

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:58.310
Can you keep the specifics 
of this creature's death a secret?

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.060
But...

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:00.930
Please.

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.040
I understand.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.390
If you insist, Sir Knight...

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:09.350
You have my gratitude.

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.830
What's that ring?

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:26.290
S-So scary...

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:30.020
The fanged boars that have been 
showing up near the village

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:32.760
may have been chased there by this beast.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:36.120
It's much scarier than any old boar.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:36.970
Grr, grr!

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:37.820
Miss Marca.

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:41.680
Is that one of the fanged boars in question?

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.180
Y-Yes!

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.510
I see.

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:47.800
Then we'll make him 
into a gift for the village!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:56.410
Sir Knight, where'd 
this fanged boar come from?

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.530
I'll be taking the fangs 
and rune stone as my reward,

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:02.520
but could you see about tanning the hide?

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:05.270
I intend to hand it over to Miss Marca.

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:06.720
Really?

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.320
Hooray!

00:17:08.320 --> 00:17:10.610
The meat should be shared 
among the villagers.

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:15.200
Sir Knight was really strong, you know!

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.260
Marca!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.080
Mother...

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.350
I'm sorry.

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:33.030
Mother?

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.400
I'm just glad you're all right.

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:37.480
So very much...

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:44.930
But Marca, why did you go into the woods?

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:47.590
Didn't I tell you not to leave the village?

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:49.750
I...

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.860
I gathered these.

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:56.500
Marca, you...

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:58.800
Madam.

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.680
I apologize.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.080
I should have thought more carefully of it.

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:09.200
It was careless of me to take Miss Marca 
into the woods without consulting you.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:10.950
Oh, no, that's...

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:15.040
I would ask that you not scold her, please.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:19.100
I've never met a child 
who cares more for her mother.

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:24.530
I know. And thank you.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:30.520
I'm curious, Sir Knight, 
did you run into any danger?

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:36.590
There's been word of a truly 
fearsome monster in the forest today.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.030
Oh, no,

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:41.230
there was nothing 
in the woods I couldn't handle,

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:43.050
so I wouldn't worry.

00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:45.140
That's good to hear.

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:50.030
You're really lucky not to have run 
into the abomination, Sir Knight.

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:53.840
Indeed I am! Truly lucky!

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.860
Isn't that right, Miss Marca?

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:57.210
Yes!

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:08.620
Sir Knight, thank you again.

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:14.660
No, you taught me 
a great deal today, Miss Marca.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.830
Sir Knight, here!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:24.950
Oh, what have we here? 
Is this for me?

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.310
Yeah!

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:28.630
There.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.740
I can't imagine a greater reward.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:39.840
Take care, Ponta.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:45.040
Well, I suppose I should be on my way.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.000
Um, Sir Knight?

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:56.670
Will I ever see you again?

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.380
Surely, some day.

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:14.770
Corner it!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:19.020
Archers! Fire!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:23.240
End it now! Lancers, charge!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:33.960
We killed it!

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.360
Hooray!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:37.240
We won!

00:20:36.070 --> 00:20:37.240
Yes!

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:46.780
The casualties amount to 15 dead 
and 38 injured.

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:47.490
Could you look at this?

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:52.670
That's worse than expected, 
even for dealing with an eight-meter basilisk.

00:20:52.670 --> 00:20:55.920
Yes, it was an extremely 
powerful specimen...

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:59.630
And there's one other bit of news.

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.100
There was another?!

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:12.420
Yes.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:14.720
It seems to have been 
slain with a single blow.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:15.760
Not only that,

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:18.670
but it seems to have been 
delivered by a single individual...

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:21.660
Someone slayed that beast by themselves?

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:23.170
Unbelievable.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.710
And with a single strike...?

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:32.340
They'd have to be a god. Or perhaps...

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:35.370
the devil himself.

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:42.050
Ponta, looks like we've 
safely completed another job.

00:21:43.520 --> 00:21:45.350
Monsters, huh...?

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:48.520
I want to keep a low profile.

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:52.400
And that hasn't changed, but...

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:03.820
Maybe I should try a more 
challenging quest tomorrow!

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:44.980
Next Time

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:44.980
An Austere Elf Dances for Her Comrades

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Fried tofu or tempura, which do you prefer!?
#soba #udon #HangingWithPonta</b>
